{
  "schema": "doc-card/v1",
  "code": "NL06.4",
  "chapter": "NL06",
  "title": "矩即导数：$i^{k}$ 因子与实虚分槽",
  "src": {
    "file": "notebook/math/survey/p6-prob.tex",
    "sha256": "sha256:64e47f763c4110757051d84ae9bab7a30da9592fe882cd1ef3ce0c5054ce7ca3"
  },
  "notebook_commit": "c02b35dce350b9ee697fe098a85acf42bbac5c5a",
  "notebook_dirty": false,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "NL06.4:body.s01",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "是什么",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "$\\varphi^{(k)}(0)=i^{k}E[X^{k}]$。具体地：$\\varphi'(0)=i\\mu$（纯虚），\n$\\varphi''(0)=-(\\mu^{2}+\\sigma^{2})$（纯实）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL06.4:body.s02",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "为什么需要",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "它把「求矩」变成「在 0 处求导」，是从特征函数反推分布的最短路径。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL06.4:body.s03",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "关键结论",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "奇阶导数带 $i^{\\text{奇}}$ 因子，故落在虚部；偶阶落在实部。\n成立条件：$E\\left\\lvert X\\right\\rvert ^{k}<\\infty$；$0$ 处可导。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL06.4:body.s04",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "判据",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "判据必须分实/虚两槽比较；若整体用 $\\mathrm{abs2}$，符号错误会被抹平。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL06.4:body.s05",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "前置",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "P1。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL06.4:body.s06",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "常见误解",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "以为「$\\varphi$ 在 0 处的斜率就是均值」。斜率是 $i\\mu$，差一个 $i$；\n把它当实数会得到 0（因为 $\\mu$ 在虚部）。"
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
